anti_auto":"匈奴","resolved_place_entity_id":104,"start_index":129,"tongjian_id":"970ff500-db0e-11ef-afd9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["人事"],"content":"10詔徵皇甫規爲度遼將軍。初，張奐坐梁冀故吏，免官禁錮，凡諸交舊，莫敢爲言；唯規薦舉，前後七上，由是拜武威太守。及規爲度遼，到營數月，上書薦奐，「才略兼優，宜正元帥，以從衆望。若猶謂愚臣宜充舉事者，願乞宂官，以爲奐副。」朝廷從之。以奐代規爲度遼將軍，以規爲使匈奴中郞將。","content_fanyi":"桓帝下诏征召皇甫规为度辽将军。当初，张奂因身为梁冀旧部而获罪，被免去官职并禁止出任官职，凡是旧交故友，没有谁敢为他说话；唯有皇甫规举荐他，前后共七次上书，朝廷因此任命他为武威郡太守。等到皇甫规担任度辽将军，到军营数月之后，上书推荐张奂说：“他才略兼优，应当正式担任元帅，以顺从众望。如果仍认为我这个愚臣适合担任军职，就请给我一个闲散官职，作为张奂的副手。”朝廷采纳了皇甫规的建议。于是让张奂接替皇甫规为度辽将军，任命皇甫规为使匈奴中郎将。","content_jianti_auto":"10诏征皇甫规为度辽将军。初，张奂坐梁冀故吏，免官禁锢，凡诸交旧，莫敢为言；唯规荐举，前后七上，由是拜武威太守。及规为度辽，到营数月，上书荐奂，「才略兼优，宜正元帅，以从众望。若犹谓愚臣宜充举事者，愿乞宂官，以为奂副。」朝廷从之。以奂代规为度辽将军，以规为使匈奴中郞将。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":4682,"number":10,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"970ff4ea-db0e-11ef-aef1-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"護羌校尉","official_note":"護羌校尉是漢代設置的官職，負責管理羌族事務和邊防軍事，通常駐紮在涼州等地區，以維護邊疆穩定。在《資治通鑑》此段中，前護羌校尉段熲因羌族叛亂被免職，後因羌亂加劇，涼州危急，朝廷重新任命他為護羌校尉，以應對滇那等羌族的威脅，這反映了該官職在邊防軍事中的關鍵作用。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"前護羌校尉段熲","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"95160781-108b-46e1-811e-93919b96b61a"},{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"護羌校尉","official_note":"護羌校尉是漢代邊防軍事官職，專責處理羌族事務和防禦邊疆。在此段中，段熲被重新任命為護羌校尉，以應對滇那等羌族叛亂加劇、涼州幾乎失守的危機，顯示該官職在緊急情況下被啟用，以恢復邊防秩序。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"復以熲爲護羌校尉","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"4115050c-cf67-4497-96c7-2f3cdb907ca6"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":179,"link_td_description":"段颎，字纪明，武威郡姑臧县人，东汉官员，曾任护羌校尉、平羌大将、司隶校尉、三公之首太尉等职位。典故“血战积石”就来自段颎，凉州武力豪族的代表人物之一，出自武威郡段氏。","link_td_id":"Q10002673","link_td_number_id":476349,"people_name":"段熲","people_name_jianti_auto":"段颎","people_xingming":"段熲","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"970ff503-db0e-11ef-82d5-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":179,"link_td_description":"段颎，字纪明，武威郡姑臧县人，东汉官员，曾任护羌校尉、平羌大将、司隶校尉、三公之首太尉等职位。典故“血战积石”就来自段颎，凉州武力豪族的代表人物之一，出自武威郡段氏。","link_td_id":"Q10002673","link_td_number_id":476349,"people_name":"熲","people_name_jianti_auto":"颎","people_xingming":"段熲","start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"970ff509-db0e-11ef-b224-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"970ff501-db0e-11ef-b5f7-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"jiǒng","source_anchor_text":"羌校尉段熲訟冤者甚","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":15,"text":"熲","tongjian_id":"4f310b30-7229-5061-ae08-315c94e79522"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"西州","place_name_jianti_auto":"西州","resolved_place_entity_id":694,"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"970ff504-db0e-11ef-948f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"羌","place_name_jianti_auto":"羌","resolved_place_entity_id":140,"start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"970ff505-db0e-11ef-a57d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"滇那","place_name_jianti_auto":"滇那","resolved_place_entity_id":8017,"start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"970ff506-db0e-11ef-952a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"羌","place_name_jianti_auto":"羌","resolved_place_entity_id":140,"start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"970ff507-db0e-11ef-a5ff-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"涼州","place_name_jianti_auto":"凉州","resolved_place_entity_id":156,"start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"970ff508-db0e-11ef-9dfc-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"羌","place_name_jianti_auto":"羌","resolved_place_entity_id":140,"start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"970ff50a-db0e-11ef-9f26-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[{"title":"东汉与羌的战争","tongjian_id":"war_N0606"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["人事","军事"],"content":"11西州吏民守闕爲前護羌校尉段熲訟冤者甚衆；會滇那等諸種羌益熾，涼州幾亡，乃復以熲爲護羌校尉。","content_fanyi":"西州的官吏、百姓守在宫门前为前任护羌校尉段颎申冤的人很多；恰逢滇那等各部羌人势力更加炽盛，凉州几乎灭亡，朝廷于是再次任命段颎为护羌校尉。","content_jianti_auto":"11西州吏民守阙为前护羌校尉段颎讼冤者甚众；会滇那等诸种羌益炽，凉州几亡，乃复以颎为护羌校尉。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":4683,"number":11,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"970ff501-db0e-11ef-b5f7-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"賢","people_name_jianti_auto":"贤","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"970ff50e-db0e-11ef-a4f1-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"光武","people_name_jianti_auto":"光武","start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"970ff50f-db0e-11ef-803c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"970ff510-db0e-11ef-948b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"970ff511-db0e-11ef-9252-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"賢曰：璫以金爲之，當冠前附以金蟬也。漢官儀曰：中常侍，秦官也，漢興，或用士人，銀璫左貂，光武以後，專任宦者，右貂金璫。常伯，侍中。處，昌呂翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"贤曰：珰以金为之，当冠前附以金蝉也。汉官仪曰：中常侍，秦官也，汉兴，或用士人，银珰左貂，光武以后，专任宦者，右貂金珰。常伯，侍中。处，昌吕翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":64,"tongjian_id":"970ff50d-db0e-11ef-b32e-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"賢","people_name_jianti_auto":"贤","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"970ff518-db0e-11ef-8e30-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"復，扶又翻。賢曰：省，覽也。省，悉井翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"复，扶又翻。贤曰：省，览也。省，悉井翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":199,"tongjian_id":"970ff517-db0e-11ef-b6c2-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_peopl